## ---- PCI Express edge connector (x8): lanes 0-3 in MGT bank 116, lanes 4-7 in bank 115 ----
## PCIE_CLK_P/N: reference clock from the slot (bank 115, MGTREFCLK0).
## CKOUT1_P/N: on-board 100 MHz LVDS oscillator U14 (bank 116, MGTREFCLK0).
## Lane 0 is the GTX channel MGTX*3_116 and lane 7 MGTX*0_115: reversed, as usual for an edge card.
## Nothing of this was tried.
## PCIE_PERST_N is a normal I/O on bank 16 (VCCO set by SW11).
## GT pins take no IOSTANDARD; placement normally follows from the GT channel LOC.
